  "solution": {
    "text": "Given specific heat of the water <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>4200</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">J</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi>kg</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#176;</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></math><br /><br />Latent heat of the water <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mn>2260</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mtext>&#8201;</mtext><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">k</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">J</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">k</mi><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo></math><br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Q</mi><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi><mo>&#215;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi></math><br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Q</mi><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#916;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">T</mi><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">L</mi></math><br /><br /><math><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi><mo>&#215;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#916;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">T</mi><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">L</mi></math><br /><br /><math><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfrac><mrow><msubsup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msubsup></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">R</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>&#215;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mi mathvari